Hi ST community,

I create a simple application using USART1 baudrate 9600 TX pin - PB6 & Rx pin - PB7. I send uart frame each 1 second. J22 connects to CP210x. I see that the RX led of CP210x toggle each 1 second but when I open terminal screen on the laptop with same baudrate, nothing is shown. HAL\_transmit return HAL\_OK. Tx pin and Rx GPIO pin is configured as default, no pull up and pull down. What is problem here?

